        <mxCell id="i_actors" value="&#xa;• &lt;b&gt;Junior High School Students&lt;/b&gt; — Primary&#xa;  data submitters through vent entries and&#xa;  bullying incident reports.&#xa;&#xa;• &lt;b&gt;Guidance Counselors&lt;/b&gt; — System reviewers&#xa;  and responders who manage flagged cases.&#xa;&#xa;• &lt;b&gt;Super Administrators&lt;/b&gt; — System&#xa;  configurators who manage user accounts&#xa;  and enforce compliance.&#xa;&#xa;• &lt;b&gt;Parents / Guardians&lt;/b&gt; — Emergency alert&#xa;  recipients via SMS and email notifications.&#xa;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Garamond;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="50" y="125" width="420" height="200" as="geometry" />
