        <mxCell id="i_dev" value="&#xa;• Windows 10 or higher (Development environment)&#xa;• Laragon (PHP + MySQL local server)&#xa;• PHP 8+ / CodeIgniter 4 (Backend logic)&#xa;• Python 3.10+ &amp;amp; FastAPI (AI microservice)&#xa;• MySQL (Database storage with AES-256)&#xa;• Visual Studio Code (Code editing)&#xa;• HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript&#xa;• Tailwind CSS (Responsive design)&#xa;• Chart.js (Data visualization)&#xa;• Local SMS Gateway (Android-based)&#xa;• HuggingFace Transformers&#xa;  (mDeBERTa-v3 &amp;amp; DistilRoBERTa)&#xa;• InfinityFree (Cloud Hosting for PHP &amp;amp; MySQL)&#xa;• Microsoft Azure for Students&#xa;  (Hosting for FastAPI microservice)&#xa;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Garamond;fontColor=#000000;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="50" y="560" width="420" height="310" as="geometry" />
